Modification notice

This repository (Bookorbit Dashboard for KOReader) is a modified version of
BookOrbit and is not an official BookOrbit release.

Modified 2026-10-24: derived from the BookOrbit KOReader plugin
(koreader-plugin/bookorbit.koplugin, upstream commit
99aa7dce705986eac29a8f73aa65331de5f50680). Everything that talks to a
BookOrbit server (sign-in, sync, catalog, downloads, updates, achievements)
was removed; the widget dashboard was kept and now reads only local KOReader
data (home folder, reading history, book sidecars, collections, statistics
and vocabulary databases). Modules were renamed from bookorbit_* to
dashboard_*, and the plugin folder is bookorbitdashboard.koplugin.

Source: https://github.com/thepixelpro366/bookorbit-dashboard.koplugin
